<title>USA: Boeing says MD merger is positive for shareholders.</title>
<headline>Boeing says MD merger is positive for shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phil Condit, who will be chairman of a merged company of Boeing Co and McDonnell Douglas Corp said the merger would be positive for shareholders.</p>
<p>&quot;I think it's positive,&quot; Condit said when asked by reporters what the merger would mean for company shareholders.</p>
<p>&quot;The thing that drives shareholder value is the future, they're buying your capability for the future,&quot; he said.  </p>
<p>Condit earlier declined comment on how the merger might affect earnings next year.</p>
</text>
